flowchart TD
    A[Patient Portal Access] --> B{Account Exists?}
    B -->|No| C[Create Account]
    B -->|Yes| D[Login]
    
    %% Account Creation Flow
    C --> C1{Account Initiation Type}
    C1 -->|Self-Initiated| C2[Full Registration Form]
    C1 -->|Clinic-Initiated| C3[Staff Pre-registration]
    
    C2 --> C2a[Personal Information<br/>Name/DOB/Gender/Phone/Email]
    C2a --> C2a1[Phone OTP Verification<br/>SMS verification modal]
    C2a1 --> C2a2[Password Setup<br/>Strength validation]
    C2a2 --> C2a3[Terms & Privacy Consent<br/>Required checkboxes]
    
    C2 --> C2b{Age Verification Logic}
    C2b -->|Under 13| C2b1[Registration Blocked<br/>Parent account prompt]
    C2b1 --> C2b1a[Send Link to Parent<br/>Guardian redirect option]
    C2b -->|13-17| C2b2[Teen Registration<br/>Guardian awareness checkbox]
    C2b -->|18+| C2b3[Adult Registration<br/>Family management enabled]
    
    C2b3 --> C2c[Family Management Setup<br/>Add dependents option]
    C2c --> C2c1[Add Family Member Toggle<br/>Dependent registration modal]
    C2c1 --> C2c1a[Child Information Form<br/>Name/DOB/Gender/Relationship]
    C2c1 --> C2c1b[Multiple Dependents<br/>Add more children option]
    
    C3 --> C3a[Staff Entry Form<br/>Basic patient details]
    C3a --> C3b[Activation Email<br/>Secure link generation]
    C3b --> C3c[Password Setup Page<br/>Patient activation]
    C3c --> C2a3
    
    C2 --> C4[Accessibility Features<br/>Screen reader/High contrast]
    C2a3 --> C5[Account Verification<br/>Email confirmation]
    C5 --> E[Dashboard]
    
    %% Login Flow
    D --> D1[Login Credentials<br/>Email/Phone + Password]
    D1 --> D2{Account Status}
    D2 -->|Active| E
    D2 -->|Pending| D3[Account Pending<br/>Activation required]
    D2 -->|Deactivated| D4[Reactivation Option<br/>Account recovery]
    D4 --> D4a[Reactivation Confirmation<br/>Identity verification]
    D4a --> E
    
    %% Dashboard
    E --> E1[Personalized Greeting<br/>Dynamic welcome message]
    E1 --> E1a[Time-based Greeting<br/>Good Morning/Afternoon]
    E1 --> E1b[Family Member Selection<br/>Profile switcher dropdown]
    E1b --> E1b1[Profile Photos & Names<br/>Family member list]
    E1b --> E1b2[Context Refresh<br/>Dynamic data update]
    
    E --> E2[Quick Navigation Cards<br/>Action shortcuts]
    E2 --> E2a[Book Appointment Card<br/>Family-aware booking]
    E2 --> E2b[Medical Records Card<br/>Personal/dependent access]
    E2 --> E2c[Payments Card<br/>Billing dashboard]
    E2 --> E2d[Messages Card<br/>Communication center]
    
    E --> E3[Live Appointments Widget<br/>Upcoming appointments feed]
